                                "sense_id": "4ed0d95a-4235-372f-84b1-25486447e5e1",
                                "text": "Gules a Bordure Argent charged with Verdoy of Trefoils slipped proper, that is Vert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30c121c8-22c5-46f1-8d13-def6fb326d18",
                                "sense_id": "4ed0d95a-4235-372f-84b1-25486447e5e1",
                                "text": "SCOTT of Hedderwick, a younger son of Scott of Logie, argent, a fesse crenellé, between three lions' heads erased, gules; within a bordure of the last, verdoy of six flower-de-luces of the first."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c1bf5a9-e8ca-4019-b751-d307614c4b02",
                                "sense_id": "4ed0d95a-4235-372f-84b1-25486447e5e1",
                                "text": "Quarterly; 1st and 4th, the arms of France and England, quarterly; 2d, arms of Scotland; and 3d, those of Ireland; the whole within a border compone, argent and gules, the first charged with verdoy of roses of the second[…]"
                            }
                        ]
